{"title":"샹그릴라 프론티어 [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=1qzh3/dJMcackbBWi/tNQKGNf1qtD2qvY9NExqFK&filename=th3","synopsis":"최강의 망겜 게이머에 의한 최고의 게임 모험담!!\n\n‘망겜’을 각별하게 사랑하는 남자 히즈토메 라쿠로.\n그가 다음으로 도전한 게임은 플레이어의 숫자가 3000만 명에 달하는 ‘갓겜’\n‘샹그릴라 프론티어’였다!\n모이는 동료, 확장되는 세계.\n그리고 ‘숙적’과의 만남이 그와 모든 플레이어의 운명을 바꾸어 간다!!\n대인기 WEB소설을 기적의 만화화!\n최고의 게임×판타지 모험담, 개막!!\n\nSHANGRI – LA FRONTIER\nⒸ Katarina, Ryosuke Fuji 2020\nAll rights reserved.\nFirst published in Japan in 2020 by Kodansha Ltd.\nKorean translation rights arranged by Kodansha Ltd.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":94,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":113,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":196,"change":{"type":"down","amount":83}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":150,"change":{"type":"up","amount":46}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":250,"change":{"type":"down","amount":100}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":273,"change":{"type":"down","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":108,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":75,"change":{"type":"up","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":83,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":77,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":178,"change":{"type":"down","amount":101}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":252,"change":{"type":"down","amount":74}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":124,"change":{"type":"up","amount":128}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":118,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":190,"change":{"type":"down","amount":72}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":245,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":191,"change":{"type":"up","amount":54}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":248,"change":{"type":"down","amount":57}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":264,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":134,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2